      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To mitigate the short-term risks of capital flight, I propose a phased implementation of the progressive tax plan, starting with targeted wealth surcharges rather than across-the-board steep rate increases. Concurrently, we will use carefully crafted information dissemination to clearly link the tax revenue to visible public benefits, such as infrastructure investment, thus building public buy-in. This strategy aims to achieve necessary wealth redistribution while proactively managing agent behavior and perception.",
      "source": "target",
